    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "75eb2b15-f203-3a08-be2b-53e7159c0b71",
                "word": "Hitler",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dc85883f-b3a7-3344-9a47-806d56f3169c",
                        "entry_id": "75eb2b15-f203-3a08-be2b-53e7159c0b71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A surname from Austrian German."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed3db8ea-4a92-4507-bc48-6a0d4ecca8eb",
                                "sense_id": "dc85883f-b3a7-3344-9a47-806d56f3169c",
                                "text": "It was reminiscent of the rallies held by Adolph Hitler during the 1930s-1940s before adoring crowds in Nazi Germany. At many of these Nazi rallies, the German participants swore personal allegiance to their nation’s leader-Adolph Hitler over and above their own Nation-Germany."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "546b57d2-e568-347b-8944-88d64ea5e6de",
                        "entry_id": "75eb2b15-f203-3a08-be2b-53e7159c0b71",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A surname from Austrian German.",
                            "Ellipsis of Adolf Hitler; Führer of the Nazi Party and chancellor of Germany from 1933 to 1945; particularly as the embodiment of Nazism."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "ellipsis"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "21227aeb-72e4-4bd2-a231-f2c8309f715a",
                                "sense_id": "546b57d2-e568-347b-8944-88d64ea5e6de",
                                "text": "The British ruling class are fighting against Hitler, whom they have always regarded and whom some of them still regard as their protector against Bolshevism. That does not mean that they will deliberately sell out; but it does mean that at every decisive moment they are likely to falter, pull their punches, do the wrong thing. Until the Churchill Government called some sort of halt to the process, they have done the wrong thing with an unerring instinct ever since 1931."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d9521ab-449f-4fb2-8bfe-300051f486a8",
                                "sense_id": "546b57d2-e568-347b-8944-88d64ea5e6de",
                                "text": "Clearly, Hitler saw his historical function as a Wagnerian grand opera. Vast cosmic changes required an accompaniment of slaughter on a colossal scale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c6cd0e16-e123-4cd9-9e08-9680e182a63c",
                                "sense_id": "546b57d2-e568-347b-8944-88d64ea5e6de",
                                "text": "What is one curious about when he asks, What is evil? The question makes no sense, unless the questioner is satisfied with such answers as: Death is evil, pain is evil, Hitler is evil."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7010f03a-88e2-485e-8968-1f072de64ea2",
                                "sense_id": "546b57d2-e568-347b-8944-88d64ea5e6de",
                                "text": "...the description we give of God’s knowledge concerning Hitler has to be different after Hitler’s death; it is manifest that there has been a change on Hitler’s side, and that this, in view of the logic of omniscience, makes a difference to what we can truly say about God’s knowledge; it is not manifest that there must have been a real change of mind on God's side. And Aquinas can say this..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "009a7020-8a59-4bc2-8d5d-08fd1d570bcf",
                                "sense_id": "546b57d2-e568-347b-8944-88d64ea5e6de",
                                "text": "Mueller is even less convincing in his suggestion that World War II might never have happened if Hitler had never been born."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "314a6373-acc4-4318-983a-aa4cf4701ef0",
                                "sense_id": "546b57d2-e568-347b-8944-88d64ea5e6de",
                                "text": "People do evil things (Hitler, Stalin, Saddam Hussein)."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9ab16bac-ea9a-44d6-a05a-4470e82c9315",
                        "source_entry_id": "75eb2b15-f203-3a08-be2b-53e7159c0b71",
                        "source_sense_description": "Adolf Hitler",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hitler",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hitler",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8323f059-9ab8-33e9-9773-4b417584d4d8",
                                        "entry_id": "3bcd4184-4f0b-3f58-a4e5-3cae86bbea30",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "příjmení rakouského původu"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5544a6d4-6d52-462f-bc61-4f1ae83a2dcd",
                                                "sense_id": "8323f059-9ab8-33e9-9773-4b417584d4d8",
                                                "text": "Princezna Hohenlohe byla přítelkyní nacistů, lord Harold Sidney Rothermere nadržoval fašistickým živlům v Británii, sympatizoval s Hitlerem, byl pro mnichovskou dohodu, podporoval maďarské revanšisty v protičeskoslovenské politice."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91739ab7-bdf2-495d-8711-ad9aea44c1a5",
                                                "sense_id": "8323f059-9ab8-33e9-9773-4b417584d4d8",
                                                "text": "Stalin neměl v úmyslu obnovit rovnováhu sil v Evropě, naopak chtěl Evropu ovládnout stejně totálně, jako se o to předtím pokoušel Hitler."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f7cce82-a573-4242-b9bf-77fb53edcbe5",
                                                "sense_id": "8323f059-9ab8-33e9-9773-4b417584d4d8",
                                                "text": "Ostatně kdyby mu nevlastní otec nezměnil jméno, Hitler by se jmenoval Schicklgruber, to jest „Ten-kdo-kope-rigol-aby-odvedl-močůvku“. S podobným jménem by to Adolf dotáhl nanejvýš na celního inspektora a nejobludnější válka v dějinách by nikdy neproběhla."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hitler",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4bc7cf67-8822-3ffa-9989-6606f50b2497",
                                        "entry_id": "a55d1c24-b793-3e39-a76d-51d098acab44",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Heil Hitler"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b0ba8f91-7799-471d-bd41-5d5bfac4979c",
                        "source_entry_id": "75eb2b15-f203-3a08-be2b-53e7159c0b71",
                        "source_sense_description": "Adolf Hitler",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hitler",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hitler",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d1da067-b5c8-3f58-9808-a2b12c5cc283",
                                        "entry_id": "c7f0368b-790f-3601-8632-63f9d1b0c561",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom de famille, surtout connu par Adolf Hitler."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3033aaa7-5b4f-405c-b523-aca366cda8af",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da067-b5c8-3f58-9808-a2b12c5cc283",
                                                "text": "Tandis qu’Hitler, ça sonnait pas méchant, ça faisait presque français. Avec sa petite moustache et sa mèche, il avait un air pauvre et méritant, un peu rêveur. J’espérais bien qu’il gagnerait son duel contre cette sale gueule de vache d’Hindenburg, et en effet il le gagna. Enfin, c’est ce que j’ai cru comprendre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ce80ec6-ae14-4c67-836d-973c6576019f",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da067-b5c8-3f58-9808-a2b12c5cc283",
                                                "text": "Les deux côtés de la famille Hitler, dont le nom peut s'écrire Hiedler, Huttler ou Hitler, sont originaires du Waldviertel, une région située à moins de cent kilomètres de Vienne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e80761b-8e6b-4fc6-85c3-9952a79dc5f8",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da067-b5c8-3f58-9808-a2b12c5cc283",
                                                "text": "Ainsi, je suis incapable de me rappeler quand j’ai entendu prononcer pour la première fois le nom de Hitler, ce nom auquel nous sommes maintenant forcés, depuis des années, de faire une place dans nos pensées, que nous sommes obligés de prononcer, le nom d’un homme qui a déversé plus de malheurs dans notre monde qu’aucun autre avant lui."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5cd70ac-bd96-49de-a203-cb5055df8328",
                                                "sense_id": "3d1da067-b5c8-3f58-9808-a2b12c5cc283",
                                                "text": "Hitler, Staline, Mussolini, tout le monde connaît leurs crimes et leurs capacités de nuisance sur leurs congénères."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1582e690-24f4-43b3-a9f7-dad243dc5728",
                        "source_entry_id": "75eb2b15-f203-3a08-be2b-53e7159c0b71",
                        "source_sense_description": "Adolf Hitler",
                        "target_lang_word": "Hitler",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Hitler",
